[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4850370503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117822#issuecomment-4850370503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117822","id":4850370503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIRrHxw","user":{"login":"SheepYhangCN","id":44539204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTM5MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44539204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN","html_url":"https://github.com/SheepYhangCN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T04:54:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T04:54:31Z","body":"> Since the description in #116051 is a bit convoluted, let me reword the issue:\r\n> \r\n> > * `locale/fallback` is set to source language `X` (the language in which hardcoded strings are written)\r\n> > * The project only provides translations for language `Y`\r\n> > * The current locale is set to `X`\r\n> > \r\n> > When `X` and `Y` are related (e.g., `fr` and `fr_CA`, `en_GB` and `en_US`, `zh_Hans` and `zh_Hant`), the translation for language `Y` is used directly, rather than the original string.\r\n> \r\n> This process does not actually involve `locale/fallback`, so skipping `locale/fallback` does not solve this problem.\r\n> \r\n> What you need is skipping the whole translation process in this situation I think.\r\n\r\nOkaaaay I might misunderstood the original Issue\r\nI thought the problem of original issue was \"If fall back language doesn't exists, fall back process will fail and the game will keep current language\"\r\nSo I thought this PR may solve that\r\n\r\nI'm gonna remove the fixes relationship, and I might gonna think of another solution for that Issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4850370503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4894770774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117822#issuecomment-4894770774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117822","id":4894770774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI8BGVg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:45:23